<title>CHINA: Peregrine sets warrants on COSCO Pacific.</title>
<headline>Peregrine sets warrants on COSCO Pacific.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peregrine Derivatives Ltd said on Friday  it launched 128.80 million American-style call warrants on shares  of COSCO Pacific Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$17.90     PREMIUM	 24.3 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.435     GEARING	 4.1x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  29.JUN.98    LISTING DATE  22.AUG.97</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG    PAYDATE	 19.AUG.97</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$17.90     MIN EXER LOT  20,000</p>
<p> SETTLEMENT	  PHYSICAL SHARES WITH CASH ALTERNATIVE AT</p>
<p>DISCRETION OF ISSUER</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
